    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demons have found a way through to our dimension. A special group was created to combat this and you are a part of this group. Choose a mission location, clear enemies, search for special items and clues, and summon and destroy the boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level has its enemy types and look, and bosses are randomized. Bosses have different abilities and phases creating a unique battle once summoned. Custom mission settings offer an easy or harder experience and provide some randomness to each mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unnatural Investigations is a multiplayer team-based action shooter with horror elements. You can play it solo but it's meant to be played with friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single-player mode will come as a free DLC later.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Current State</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two medium-sized levels to explore, search for clues, eliminate enemies, and destroy the boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One boss class with 3 different boss types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom match/mission modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Private and public servers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 players Co-op play</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demons have found a way through to our dimension. A special group was created to combat this and you are a part of this group. Choose a mission location, clear enemies, search for special items and clues, and summon and destroy the boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level has its enemy types and look, and bosses are randomized. Bosses have different abilities and phases creating a unique battle once summoned. Custom mission settings offer an easy or harder experience and provide some randomness to each mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unnatural Investigations is a multiplayer team-based action shooter with horror elements. You can play it solo but it's meant to be played with friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single-player mode will come as a free DLC later.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Current State</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two medium-sized levels to explore, search for clues, eliminate enemies, and destroy the boss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One boss class with 3 different boss types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom match/mission modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Private and public servers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 players Co-op play</p></li></ul>",
